          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-glad.webp",
            text: _("The fabled Gryphon Mountain! It’s not the tallest mountain in Wesnoth, nor the widest, but is held in renown by poets and scholars alike for the beautiful gryphons who come here to nest. It’s nice to take a break from all our fighting and experience nature."),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Burlin",
            type: "Dwarvish Pathfinder",
            side: 2,
            x: 20,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Burlin",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Burlin",
            text: _("Hey! Hey, kid!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Burlin",
            x: 25,
            y: 16,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Burlin",
            text: _("You look like a strapping young lad! What do you say about doin’ a bit o’ work for old uncle Burlin?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("I might be interested. What kind of work?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Burlin",
            text: _("The <b><i>best</i></b> kind o’ work: well-paying! I’s got a contract to collect fifty gryphon eggs, see? But I ain’t excited to risk my crew’s lives on the job."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Burlin",
            text: _("So, I say you an’ I make a deal. You kill off the gryphons for me, an’ when I make my sale t’ the queen I’ll split the profit with ye’, 70-30."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-mad.webp",
            text: _("The queen? You’re working for Asheviere?! I’d never ally myself with such a villain!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Burlin",
            text: _("... well aye, o’ course I’m workin’ for her! Ain’t this the middle o’ Wesnoth? Who else would be in charge, that good-for-nothin’ rebel Konrad? Hey— did I say 70-30? I meant 50-50!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Burlin",
            text: _("Err... look, Your Highness, this is just business. I’ve got nothin’ ’gainst neither you nor Asheviere, but I do want to keep my word an’ do my job."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Burlin",
            text: _("Work together with me now, an’ once I’ve cleaned out the nests I’ll let you have your pick of the eggs. Gryphons’re worth somethin’ fierce in a scrap, ye ken? _ I’ll even send some o’ my crew with you, to help you train your gryphons once they hatch!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Burlin",
            text: _("You get yer rebel army, an’ I get my big sack o’ gold from the queen. Everyone wins, an’ nobody has to die."),
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "s50_burlin_income_penalty",
            value: 20,
          },
          {
            tag: "dialogue",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "message",
                speaker: "Konrad",
                text: _(""),
              },
              {
                tag: "choice",
                text: _(""),
                event: "ev_40_opt0",
              },
              {
                tag: "choice",
                text: _(""),
                event: "ev_40_opt1",
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
